  "description": "Zero-dependency embedded dashboard for CSharpEssentials.LoggerHelper. Add one line — app.MapLoggerHelperDashboard() — and get a live HTML page showing active/failed sinks, startup errors, routing configuration, and health status. No Seq, no Kibana, no Grafana required. The first .NET logging library with a built-in diagnostics UI. Auto-refreshes every 30 seconds.",
